```
pom.xml
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
deploy/mysql/schema.sql
src/main/java/com/example/crobat/
  Main.java

  config/
    Config.java              environment variables + defaults

  domain/
    Priority.java            enum CRITICAL, HIGH, NORMAL, LOW
    TaskStatus.java          enum ACTIVE, PAUSED, DELETED
    JobStatus.java           enum PENDING, RUNNING, SUCCEEDED, DEAD
    RequestSpec.java         method, url, headers, body
    RetryPolicy.java         maxAttempts, backoffMs
    Task.java                configuration + normalize/firstRun/nextAfter/newJob
    Job.java                 one execution + apply(result)
    Result.java              one HTTP attempt's outcome
    CronSchedule.java        wraps cron-utils
    Backoff.java             exponential backoff calculation
    FairPick.java            per-tenant fair selection
    DomainException.java     validation error -> HTTP 400
    NotFoundException.java   missing row -> HTTP 404

  db/
    Database.java            JDBC connection helper
    SecretsCipher.java       AES-256-GCM encrypt/decrypt
    TaskStore.java           tasks table + scheduler transaction
    JobStore.java            jobs table: claim, result, lease, archive, DLQ
    HistoryStore.java        job_history table

  services/
    TaskService.java         create/get/list/update/pause/resume/delete
    JobService.java          status/history/DLQ/manual retry
    SchedulerLoop.java       due tasks -> pending jobs
    ExecutorLoop.java        claim -> timer -> HTTP -> save
    ReconcilerLoop.java      expired leases -> pending/dead
    ArchiverLoop.java        hot jobs -> history, then delete

  http/
    Json.java                shared ObjectMapper
    Jwt.java                 sign/verify HS256
    Router.java              method + path routing + auth + errors
    TaskApi.java             task routes
    JobApi.java              job routes
    EchoApi.java             /fail, /flaky, /slow, default 200
    WebUi.java               static files + React Router fallback

  call/
    HttpCaller.java          HttpClient wrapper, headers, timeout
    SsrfGuard.java           public-IP / port / no-proxy checks

  cli/
    Cli.java                 token, task, job commands

frontend/
  package.json               React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind
  vite.config.ts             dev server proxy for /tasks, /jobs, /dlq
  tailwind.config.js
  src/
    main.tsx                 BrowserRouter
    App.tsx                  routes
    api.ts                   fetch wrapper with the bearer token
    types.ts                 API types (snake_case)
    components/              layout, token bar, badges
    pages/                   overview, tasks, create, detail, DLQ
```

Dependency direction:

```
Main -> services -> db, domain, call
Main -> http    -> services, domain
db, http, call  -> domain
domain          -> nothing from the project
```

`domain` has no JDBC, no HTTP, no config. This keeps the rules testable and
readable.

