| `FairPick` | `FairPick.pick` |
| `internal/app/ports.go` | concrete `TaskStore`, `JobStore`, `HistoryStore` |
| `internal/services/taskservice` | `TaskService` |
| `internal/services/scheduler` | `SchedulerLoop` |
